# AI Coach Brain (W10)
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/
# Without a key, the coach runs in a graceful OFFLINE DEMO mode (no live Claude
# calls) — handy so a demo never dies on stage.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the coach model (defaults to claude-sonnet-4-6, which is
# fast + streams great for a live demo). For maximum depth at higher latency,
# use the flagship:
# COACH_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
